.TH AVR\-BILLING\-PAYMENT\-METHODS\-ADD 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-billing-payment-methods-add \- Add a credit card as a payment method.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr billing payment-methods add
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a credit card as a payment method.
.PP
Opens the billing page of the Avrea console, where you enter the card and complete any 3D Secure authentication your card issuer requires. Card details go directly to Stripe and never pass through the CLI or Avrea servers.
.PP
The command waits until the new card appears.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods-list (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods-remove (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods-set-default (1)
